   "She studied as a pharmacist undergraduate before switching to programing, and she spent 12 years as a school administrator &mdash; so her command of written and spoken English is excellent. She's also a great communicator, using her listening skills to patiently understand what people from different cultures are saying. As she puts it, &lsquo;When we talk, we need to meet in the middle.&rsquo;",
